-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software referenced by this project
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

img2threejs
  https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  This repository is a companion to img2threejs, not a fork. No source files from
  img2threejs are copied here. The scripts call its command-line tools
  (forge/stage3_build/generate_threejs_factory.py, forge/stage4_review/append_review.py)
  and follow the pass ladder and spec schema that project defines. Install or clone it
  separately; nothing is vendored.

three.js
  https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js
  Licensed under the MIT License.

  Installed by assets/build/setup_workspace.sh into a throwaway build directory
  (pinned to three@0.169.0). Not redistributed by this repository. Generated
  deliverables embed a bundle of three.js and therefore carry the MIT license and
  its copyright notice when shipped to end users.

esbuild
  https://github.com/evanw/esbuild
  Licensed under the MIT License.

  Installed into the same throwaway build directory (pinned to esbuild@0.24.0) and
  used only to bundle the viewer. Not redistributed by this repository.

Playwright
  https://github.com/microsoft/playwright
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  Optional development dependency (playwright-core), used to drive a locally
  installed Chrome for the capture and interaction tests. Not redistributed here,
  and no browser binaries are bundled.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not included
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Product photographs used while developing this skill are deliberately absent from
the repository. Every example workspace is created by the user from their own
images. Brand names that appear in documentation (for instance the headphone model
used as a worked example) identify the subject of a test run only; nothing in this
repository is affiliated with, endorsed by, or licensed by those brands.